{
  "name": "OI · Reserva de cita con hueco comprobado",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "name": "Widget de reservas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "reserva",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "oi-0009",
      "id": "oi-0031",
      "position": [
        260,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Preparar franja",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const b = $json.body ?? $json;\nconst inicio = new Date(b.fecha + 'T' + b.hora + ':00');\nconst fin = new Date(inicio.getTime() + (b.duracion ?? 60) * 60000);\nreturn [{ json: { ...b, inicio: inicio.toISOString(), fin: fin.toISOString() } }];"
      },
      "id": "oi-0032",
      "position": [
        500,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ver si hay hueco",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "primary",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {},
        "returnAll": true,
        "timeMin": "={{ $json.inicio }}",
        "timeMax": "={{ $json.fin }}"
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Calendar (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0033",
      "position": [
        740,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "¿Está libre?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// getAll devuelve un item vacío cuando no hay eventos\nconst eventos = items.filter(i => i.json.id);\nconst datos = $('Preparar franja').first().json;\nreturn [{ json: { ...datos, libre: eventos.length === 0, ocupados: eventos.length } }];"
      },
      "id": "oi-0034",
      "position": [
        980,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "¿Franja libre?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "oi-0010",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.libre }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "oi-0035",
      "position": [
        1220,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Crear la cita",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "primary",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {},
        "start": "={{ $json.inicio }}",
        "end": "={{ $json.fin }}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "summary": "={{ $json.servicio }} · {{ $json.nombre }}",
          "description": "={{ $json.telefono }} · {{ $json.email }}\\n\\n{{ $json.nota }}"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Calendar (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0036",
      "position": [
        260,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Confirmar al cliente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "hola@oistudio.eus",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "subject": "=Cita confirmada · {{ $json.fecha }} a las {{ $json.hora }}",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<p>Hola {{ $json.nombre }}:</p><p>Tu cita para <strong>{{ $json.servicio }}</strong> queda confirmada el <strong>{{ $json.fecha }}</strong> a las <strong>{{ $json.hora }}</strong>.</p><p>Si te surge algo, contestá a este correo y la movemos.</p>",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Gmail SMTP (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0037",
      "position": [
        500,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Registrar la reserva",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "ID_DE_TU_HOJA",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gid=0",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "options": {},
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {}
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "",
          "name": "Google Sheets (gratis)"
        }
      },
      "id": "oi-0038",
      "position": [
        740,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Buscar alternativas",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Dos huecos siguientes de la misma duración\nconst d = $json, base = new Date(d.inicio), dur = (d.duracion ?? 60);\nconst alt = [1, 2].map(k => new Date(base.getTime() + k * dur * 60000)\n  .toISOString().slice(11, 16));\nreturn [{ json: { ok: false, motivo: 'ocupado', alternativas: alt } }];"
      },
      "id": "oi-0039",
      "position": [
        980,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Responder al widget",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "oi-0040",
      "position": [
        1220,
        420
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "oi-0041",
      "name": "Ficha",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -140,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 360,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 📅 Reserva de cita con hueco comprobado\n**auto-reserva-cita**\n\nComprueba en el calendario que la franja está libre, crea el evento y manda la confirmación. Si no hay hueco, devuelve alternativas.\n\n**Disparador:** Webhook (el widget de reservas de la web)\n\n**Coste: 0 €** — n8n autoalojado · Google Calendar · Gmail SMTP · Google Sheets\n\n- Lee los eventos de esa franja para descartar solapes\n- Crea el evento con los datos del cliente y un recordatorio propio\n- Envía confirmación con la dirección y el enlace para cancelar\n- Si está ocupado, propone las dos franjas libres más cercanas"
      }
    }
  ],
